{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "能冻结哪些",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 78.7,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "如果被盗的是你自己的钱，顺序也差不多。",
   "spoken": "如果被盗的是你自己的钱，顺序也差不多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.949
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "先撤销所有授权，把剩下的资产转到全新的地址，用新助记词、新设备。",
   "spoken": "先撤销所有授权，把剩下的资产转到全新的地址，用新助记词、新设备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 5.34,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 5.435,
   "speechEnd": 11.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "记下被盗地址、攻击者地址、交易哈希、时间，和你点过的链接。",
   "spoken": "记下被盗地址、攻击者地址、交易哈希、时间，和你点过的链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 11.64,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 11.64,
   "speechEnd": 17.076
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "被盗的是 USDT 或 USDC，马上联系发行方，附上交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "被盗的是 USDT 或 USDC，马上联系发行方，附上交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 17.46,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 17.557,
   "speechEnd": 23.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "钱流进了某个交易所，就通过它的官方渠道提交冻结请求。",
   "spoken": "钱流进了某个交易所，就通过它的官方渠道提交冻结请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 23.6,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 23.693,
   "speechEnd": 29.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "报警，拿到报案回执，交易所和发行方通常需要执法请求才能冻结。",
   "spoken": "报警，拿到报案回执，交易所和发行方通常需要执法请求才能冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 29.42,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 29.523,
   "speechEnd": 36.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "当心追回诈骗，说能帮你追回资金、要你先付费的人，几乎都是诈骗。",
   "spoken": "当心追回诈骗，说能帮你追回资金、要你先付费的人，几乎都是诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 36.52,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 36.618,
   "speechEnd": 42.043
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 42.5,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 42.5,
   "speechEnd": 43.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "发行方冻结，只能管到 USDT、USDC 这类有发行方的代币。",
   "spoken": "发行方冻结，只能管到 USDT、USDC 这类有发行方的代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 44.0,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 44.0,
   "speechEnd": 49.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "BTC、XRP、SOL 是原生资产，没有发行方，这条路管不到它们。",
   "spoken": "BTC、XRP、SOL 是原生资产，没有发行方，这条路管不到它们。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 50.22,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 50.318,
   "speechEnd": 56.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "所以第一批通知发给发行方，但不能把它当成全部方案。",
   "spoken": "所以第一批通知发给发行方，但不能把它荡成全部方案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 56.76,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 56.85,
   "speechEnd": 61.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "最有效的，是事先设计好的暂停和延迟，加上提前备好的地址清单和联系人。",
   "spoken": "最有效的，是事先设计好的暂停和延迟，加上提前备好的地址清单和联系人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 62.02,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 62.11,
   "speechEnd": 69.11
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "钱被转走之后能追回多少，大半在出事之前就定了。",
   "spoken": "钱被转走之后能追回多少，大半在出事之前就定了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 69.52,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 69.52,
   "speechEnd": 73.667
  },
  {
